   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "~1,000:1 read-to-write, and even the top of the funnel is only 3,000 requests/sec - trivially served by a cache and a read\nreplica, because hotel and room data is near-static and caches almost perfectly.",
   "originalText": "~1,000:1 read-to-write, and even the top of the funnel is only 3,000 requests/sec - trivially served by a cache and a read\nreplica, because hotel and room data is near-static and caches almost perfectly.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "cap",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1050,
   "y": 470,
   "width": 390,
   "height": 150,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100043,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700301,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1,000,000 rooms x 70% occupancy / 3-day average stay\n   = ~233,000 reservations/day  =  ~2.7 per second\n\nroughly 0.0008% of the digital wallet's peak\n\n5,000 hotels x 20 room types x 365 days x 2-year\nbooking horizon   =   73 MILLION rows\n   at ~50 bytes each  =  under 4 GB, one node,\n   indexes and all - pre-populated by a nightly cron\n   that extends the horizon by a day",
   "originalText": "1,000,000 rooms x 70% occupancy / 3-day average stay\n   = ~233,000 reservations/day  =  ~2.7 per second\n\nroughly 0.0008% of the digital wallet's peak\n\n5,000 hotels x 20 room types x 365 days x 2-year\nbooking horizon   =   73 MILLION rows\n   at ~50 bytes each  =  under 4 GB, one node,\n   indexes and all - pre-populated by a nightly cron\n   that extends the horizon by a day",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "dont",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1050,
   "y": 636,
   "width": 630,
   "height": 44,
   "strokeColor": "#047857",
   "backgroundColor": "#a7f3d0",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
