   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "it calls an external provider and can take SECONDS. A row lock held across a\nthird-party API call would serialize every booking for that hotel behind one\nslow payment. So the reservation commits as pending, payment happens outside\nthe transaction, and a second transaction confirms it - the saga shape, for\nthe oldest reason there is: never hold a lock across a network call you do\nnot control.",
   "originalText": "it calls an external provider and can take SECONDS. A row lock held across a\nthird-party API call would serialize every booking for that hotel behind one\nslow payment. So the reservation commits as pending, payment happens outside\nthe transaction, and a second transaction confirms it - the saga shape, for\nthe oldest reason there is: never hold a lock across a network call you do\nnot control.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
