   "versionNonce": 700504,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "not by the server on receipt. The booking form generates a UUID when\nit loads, so every submission of THAT FORM carries the same id: a\ndouble-click, a refresh-and-resubmit and a flaky-network retry all\narrive identical, and the second is recognised as a replay.\nGenerating it server-side would defeat the whole mechanism, because\neach retry would look like a fresh request.",
   "originalText": "not by the server on receipt. The booking form generates a UUID when\nit loads, so every submission of THAT FORM carries the same id: a\ndouble-click, a refresh-and-resubmit and a flaky-network retry all\narrive identical, and the second is recognised as a replay.\nGenerating it server-side would defeat the whole mechanism, because\neach retry would look like a fresh request.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
